# Muk's AI4Research notebook

This is the working home for your research, designs, code activities, experiments, presentations, and decisions. Start here to understand what matters now, then follow the evidence when you need detail.

**Current stage:** [[Active Stage|CC effectiveness and a personal research lab]]. The immediate coder priority is **CC accuracy and verification**; lab work continues alongside it. Milestones depend on evidence and readiness, with no committed dates.

**Start here:** [[Project Overview]] → [[Designs/CC Reference|Every capsule]] → [[Amendments/README|Coder amendments]]. For recurring talk guidance, open the [[Presentation Library/README]]. For rationale, read [[Designs/CC History|CC from the first presentations]] and [[Designs/Project Authority|what is authoritative]].

